claude: true
prompt: |
  You are working on Alien::sqlite_vec, an Alien::Base distribution that downloads
  sqlite-vec v0.1.6 and compiles it into a runtime-loadable SQLite extension. Read
  .claude/rules/alien-sqlite-vec-rules.md, then pick the top actionable ticket from
  the karr board and drive it to review. Delegate behavior-relevant work (the
  alienfile, lib/Alien/sqlite_vec.pm, t/) to alien-sqlite-vec-worker. Never edit the
  p5-sqlite-vecdb twin directly, and never run dzil release.
